{"seq":2,"slug":"task-management-synchronization","title":"任务管理与同步机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/embedded-bare-metal/rtos-basics/task-management-synchronization","wordCount":1996,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"任务管理与同步机制\">任务管理与同步机制</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>RTOS 在提供多任务能力之后，紧接着要解决的问题是：任务如何被描述、隔离，任务之间如何安全地交换数据与协调时序。本文围绕四条主线展开：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>任务载体</strong>：任务控制块（TCB）与独立栈描述一个任务，栈大小估算与溢出检测保证其安全运行</li>\n<li><strong>同步原语</strong>：二值/计数信号量用于事件通知与资源计数，互斥量用优先级继承化解优先级反转</li>\n<li><strong>数据传递</strong>：消息队列、事件组与轻量级任务通知覆盖从大数据块到多条件就绪的不同通信需求</li>\n<li><strong>并发风险</strong>：死锁的四个必要条件与对应的预防策略，是设计多任务系统必须跨越的障碍</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"任务控制块\">任务控制块</h2><p>每个 RTOS 任务由任务控制块（TCB，Task Control Block）描述，TCB 是调度器管理任务的核心数据结构：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    TCB[任务控制块 TCB] --&gt; SP[栈指针 pxTopOfStack]&#10;    TCB --&gt; PRIO[优先级 uxPriority]&#10;    TCB --&gt; STATE[状态链表节点]&#10;    TCB --&gt; EVENT[事件链表节点]&#10;    TCB --&gt; NAME[任务名称]&#10;    TCB --&gt; STACK[栈基址 pxStack]&#10;    TCB --&gt; NOTIFY[通知值/状态]&#10;    SP --&gt; TASK_STACK[任务栈空间]&#10;    TASK_STACK --&gt; CTX[保存的上下文]&#10;    TASK_STACK --&gt; LOCAL[局部变量]&#10;    TASK_STACK --&gt; CALL[函数调用链]\">graph TD\n    TCB[任务控制块 TCB] --&gt; SP[栈指针 pxTopOfStack]\n    TCB --&gt; PRIO[优先级 uxPriority]\n    TCB --&gt; STATE[状态链表节点]\n    TCB --&gt; EVENT[事件链表节点]\n    TCB --&gt; NAME[任务名称]\n    TCB --&gt; STACK[栈基址 pxStack]\n    TCB --&gt; NOTIFY[通知值/状态]\n    SP --&gt; TASK_STACK[任务栈空间]\n    TASK_STACK --&gt; CTX[保存的上下文]\n    TASK_STACK --&gt; LOCAL[局部变量]\n    TASK_STACK --&gt; CALL[函数调用链]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>TCB 字段</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>pxTopOfStack</td>\n<td>StackType_t*</td>\n<td>当前栈顶位置（上下文切换保存/恢复）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>xStateListItem</td>\n<td>ListItem_t</td>\n<td>连入就绪/阻塞列表的节点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>xEventListItem</td>\n<td>ListItem_t</td>\n<td>连入事件等待列表的节点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>uxPriority</td>\n<td>UBaseType_t</td>\n<td>任务优先级（0=最低）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>pxStack</td>\n<td>StackType_t*</td>\n<td>栈区域起始地址</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>uxBasePriority</td>\n<td>UBaseType_t</td>\n<td>基础优先级（互斥量继承用）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ulNotifiedValue</td>\n<td>uint32_t</td>\n<td>任务通知值</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"任务创建与栈分配\">任务创建与栈分配</h2><h3 id=\"静态与动态创建\">静态与动态创建</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>创建方式</th>\n<th>内存分配</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>劣势</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>xTaskCreate</td>\n<td>动态（pvPortMalloc）</td>\n<td>使用简便</td>\n<td>堆碎片风险</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>xTaskCreateStatic</td>\n<td>静态（用户提供）</td>\n<td>无碎片、确定性</td>\n<td>需预分配空间</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"栈大小估算\">栈大小估算</h3><p>任务栈需容纳：函数调用深度 × 每帧局部变量 + 中断嵌套上下文 + 安全余量。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>栈大小</mtext><mo>≥</mo><mtext>最大调用深度</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>平均帧大小</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>中断上下文</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>余量</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{栈大小} \\geq \\text{最大调用深度} \\times \\text{平均帧大小} + \\text{中断上下文} + \\text{余量}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">栈大小</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">最大调用深度</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">平均帧大小</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">中断上下文</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">余量</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>实用估算策略：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>初始分配较大栈（如 1024 字）</li>\n<li>使用 uxTaskGetStackHighWaterMark() 运行时检测实际最大使用量</li>\n<li>将栈大小设为实际使用量的 1.5-2 倍作为安全裕量</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"栈溢出检测\">栈溢出检测</h3><p>FreeRTOS 提供两种运行时栈溢出检测方法：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>方法 1</strong>：每次上下文切换时检查 SP 是否越过栈底——检测速度快但可能遗漏瞬时溢出</li>\n<li><strong>方法 2</strong>：在栈底填充已知模式（0xA5A5A5A5），切换时验证——可检测被覆盖的栈底区域</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>configCHECK_FOR_STACK_OVERFLOW</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mtext> 或 </mtext><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{configCHECK\\_FOR\\_STACK\\_OVERFLOW} = 1 \\text{ 或 } 2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">configCHECK_FOR_STACK_OVERFLOW</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">或</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span></div><h2 id=\"信号量\">信号量</h2><h3 id=\"二值信号量\">二值信号量</h3><p>二值信号量用于中断与任务间的事件通知（同步）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>计数值</mtext><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{计数值} \\in \\{0, 1\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">计数值</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>典型用法：ISR 中 Give 信号量通知任务，任务 Take 信号量等待事件：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>调用者</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>xSemaphoreGive</td>\n<td>ISR</td>\n<td>计数 0→1，唤醒等待任务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>xSemaphoreTake</td>\n<td>Task</td>\n<td>计数 1→0（成功）或阻塞等待</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant ISR as 中断服务程序&#10;    participant SEM as 二值信号量&#10;    participant TASK as 等待任务&#10;&#10;    TASK-&gt;&gt;SEM: xSemaphoreTake(阻塞)&#10;    Note over TASK: 任务进入 Blocked 状态&#10;    ISR-&gt;&gt;SEM: xSemaphoreGiveFromISR&#10;    SEM--&gt;&gt;TASK: 唤醒&#10;    Note over TASK: 任务进入 Ready 状态&#10;    TASK-&gt;&gt;TASK: 执行事件处理逻辑\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant ISR as 中断服务程序\n    participant SEM as 二值信号量\n    participant TASK as 等待任务\n\n    TASK-&gt;&gt;SEM: xSemaphoreTake(阻塞)\n    Note over TASK: 任务进入 Blocked 状态\n    ISR-&gt;&gt;SEM: xSemaphoreGiveFromISR\n    SEM--&gt;&gt;TASK: 唤醒\n    Note over TASK: 任务进入 Ready 状态\n    TASK-&gt;&gt;TASK: 执行事件处理逻辑</pre><h3 id=\"计数信号量\">计数信号量</h3><p>计数信号量管理有限数量的资源：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>计数值</mtext><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>最大计数</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{计数值} \\in [0, \\text{最大计数}]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">计数值</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">最大计数</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>应用场景：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>信号量初值=资源总数（如 DMA 通道数、缓冲池大小）</li>\n<li>每次获取资源 Take（计数-1），释放 Give（计数+1）</li>\n<li>计数为 0 时获取操作阻塞</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"互斥量\">互斥量</h2><h3 id=\"优先级继承\">优先级继承</h3><p>互斥量与二值信号量的关键区别在于优先级继承（Priority Inheritance）机制：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>若高优先级任务等待低优先级任务持有的互斥量</mtext><mo>⇒</mo><mtext>临时提升持有者优先级</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{若高优先级任务等待低优先级任务持有的互斥量} \\Rightarrow \\text{临时提升持有者优先级}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">若高优先级任务等待低优先级任务持有的互斥量</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⇒</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">临时提升持有者优先级</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant L as 低优先级任务&#10;    participant M as 中优先级任务&#10;    participant H as 高优先级任务&#10;    participant MTX as 互斥量&#10;&#10;    L-&gt;&gt;MTX: Take(获取成功)&#10;    Note over L: 持有互斥量&#10;    H-&gt;&gt;MTX: Take(阻塞)&#10;    Note over L: 优先级提升到 H 级别&#10;    Note over M: M 无法抢占已提升的 L&#10;    L-&gt;&gt;MTX: Give(释放)&#10;    Note over L: 优先级恢复原值&#10;    MTX--&gt;&gt;H: 获取成功\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant L as 低优先级任务\n    participant M as 中优先级任务\n    participant H as 高优先级任务\n    participant MTX as 互斥量\n\n    L-&gt;&gt;MTX: Take(获取成功)\n    Note over L: 持有互斥量\n    H-&gt;&gt;MTX: Take(阻塞)\n    Note over L: 优先级提升到 H 级别\n    Note over M: M 无法抢占已提升的 L\n    L-&gt;&gt;MTX: Give(释放)\n    Note over L: 优先级恢复原值\n    MTX--&gt;&gt;H: 获取成功</pre><h3 id=\"优先级反转问题\">优先级反转问题</h3><p>没有优先级继承时会发生优先级反转：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>低优先级任务 L 获取互斥量</li>\n<li>高优先级任务 H 等待互斥量（被阻塞）</li>\n<li>中优先级任务 M 抢占 L 执行</li>\n<li>H 的等待时间被 M 无限期延长</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>最坏等待时间（无继承）</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>所有中优先级任务的总执行时间</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{最坏等待时间（无继承）} = \\text{所有中优先级任务的总执行时间}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">最坏等待时间（无继承）</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">所有中优先级任务的总执行时间</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>最坏等待时间（有继承）</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>L 持有互斥量期间的执行时间</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{最坏等待时间（有继承）} = \\text{L 持有互斥量期间的执行时间}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">最坏等待时间（有继承）</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">L </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">持有互斥量期间的执行时间</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"递归互斥量\">递归互斥量</h3><p>同一任务可以多次获取同一递归互斥量（计数递增），但必须释放相同次数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>解锁条件：Give 次数</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>Take 次数</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{解锁条件：Give 次数} = \\text{Take 次数}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">解锁条件：</span><span class=\"mord\">Give </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">次数</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Take </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">次数</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>适用于嵌套调用中多个层级都需要访问相同受保护资源的场景。</p>\n<h2 id=\"消息队列\">消息队列</h2><h3 id=\"工作原理\">工作原理</h3><p>消息队列（Queue）是 RTOS 中最通用的任务间通信机制，支持任意大小数据项的 FIFO 传输：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>队列长度</td>\n<td>可容纳的消息数量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>消息大小</td>\n<td>每条消息的字节数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>发送策略</td>\n<td>队满时阻塞/覆盖/丢弃</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>接收策略</td>\n<td>队空时阻塞/返回错误</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>队列内存</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>队列长度</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>消息大小</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>管理结构</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{队列内存} = \\text{队列长度} \\times \\text{消息大小} + \\text{管理结构}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">队列内存</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">队列长度</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">消息大小</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">管理结构</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"数据复制-vs-指针传递\">数据复制 vs 指针传递</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方式</th>\n<th>开销</th>\n<th>安全性</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>值复制</td>\n<td>复制整个数据</td>\n<td>高（发送后可修改原数据）</td>\n<td>小消息（≤64 字节）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>指针传递</td>\n<td>仅复制指针</td>\n<td>低（需保证缓冲区生命周期）</td>\n<td>大消息（音频帧、图像块）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"邮箱模式\">邮箱模式</h3><p>当队列长度为 1 时可作为&quot;邮箱&quot;使用——xQueueOverwrite 总是覆盖最新值，接收方始终读取最新状态：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>适用于：传感器最新值、系统状态标志</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{适用于}：\\text{传感器最新值、系统状态标志}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">适用于</span></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">：</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">传感器最新值、系统状态标志</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h2 id=\"事件组\">事件组</h2><p>事件组（Event Group）用 32 位（实际可用 24 位）位图表示多个事件标志，支持复合条件等待：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>等待条件</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>ALL</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>位与</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∨</mo><mtext>ANY</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>位或</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{等待条件} = \\text{ALL}(\\text{位与}) \\lor \\text{ANY}(\\text{位或})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">等待条件</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ALL</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">位与</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∨</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ANY</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">位或</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>API</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>xEventGroupSetBits</td>\n<td>设置一个或多个事件位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>xEventGroupWaitBits</td>\n<td>等待指定位的组合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>xEventGroupClearBits</td>\n<td>清除指定事件位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>xEventGroupSync</td>\n<td>集合点同步（所有任务到达后继续）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>典型应用——多条件就绪：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>开始处理</mtext><mo>⇔</mo><mtext>ADC_READY</mtext><mo>∧</mo><mtext>COMM_IDLE</mtext><mo>∧</mo><mtext>BUFFER_FREE</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{开始处理} \\Leftrightarrow \\text{ADC\\_READY} \\land \\text{COMM\\_IDLE} \\land \\text{BUFFER\\_FREE}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">开始处理</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⇔</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9933em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ADC_READY</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9933em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">COMM_IDLE</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9933em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">BUFFER_FREE</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h2 id=\"任务通知\">任务通知</h2><h3 id=\"轻量级同步\">轻量级同步</h3><p>任务通知（Task Notification）是 FreeRTOS 的轻量级替代方案，每个任务内置一个 32 位通知值：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对比维度</th>\n<th>信号量/队列</th>\n<th>任务通知</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>RAM 开销</td>\n<td>~80 字节/实例</td>\n<td>0（TCB 内置）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>创建步骤</td>\n<td>需显式创建</td>\n<td>无需创建</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>发送目标</td>\n<td>任意任务</td>\n<td>指定任务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多对一</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>仅一对一</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>性能</td>\n<td>标准</td>\n<td>快 ~45%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"通知操作模式\">通知操作模式</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>等效于</th>\n<th>使用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>设置位</td>\n<td>事件组</td>\n<td>多事件标志通知</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>递增</td>\n<td>计数信号量</td>\n<td>事件计数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>覆盖写</td>\n<td>邮箱</td>\n<td>传递最新数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不覆盖写</td>\n<td>队列（长度 1）</td>\n<td>传递单次数据</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"死锁预防\">死锁预防</h2><h3 id=\"死锁条件\">死锁条件</h3><p>死锁产生的四个必要条件（Coffman 条件）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>互斥</mtext><mo>∧</mo><mtext>持有等待</mtext><mo>∧</mo><mtext>不可抢占</mtext><mo>∧</mo><mtext>循环等待</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{互斥} \\land \\text{持有等待} \\land \\text{不可抢占} \\land \\text{循环等待}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">互斥</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">持有等待</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">不可抢占</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">循环等待</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"预防策略\">预防策略</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>原理</th>\n<th>实现方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>锁排序</td>\n<td>破坏循环等待</td>\n<td>所有任务按固定顺序获取互斥量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>超时获取</td>\n<td>破坏持有等待</td>\n<td>xSemaphoreTake 设置超时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合并锁</td>\n<td>减少锁粒度</td>\n<td>用一把锁保护多个资源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>避免嵌套</td>\n<td>消除持有等待</td>\n<td>获取新锁前释放已持有的锁</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>超时值选择</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>正常获取时间</mtext><mo>×</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{超时值选择} = \\text{正常获取时间} \\times 3 \\sim 5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">超时值选择</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">正常获取时间</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>超时后的处理：释放已持有的所有资源，延时后重试或报告错误。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>任务载体</strong>：TCB 记录栈指针、优先级、状态链表节点等，每个任务有独立栈；栈大小按调用深度估算并留 1.5-2 倍裕量，可用溢出检测兜底。</li>\n<li><strong>同步原语</strong>：二值信号量用于 ISR 与任务间事件通知，计数信号量管理有限资源池，互斥量通过优先级继承把最坏等待时间从&quot;所有中优先级任务执行时间&quot;压缩到&quot;持有者执行时间&quot;。</li>\n<li><strong>数据传递</strong>：消息队列支持 FIFO 传值或传指针，长度 1 时作邮箱用；事件组用位图表达多条件等待；任务通知以零 RAM 开销提供更快的轻量替代。</li>\n<li><strong>并发风险</strong>：死锁的 Coffman 四条件（互斥/持有等待/不可抢占/循环等待），可通过锁排序、超时获取、合并锁与避免嵌套来破坏。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"任务管理与同步机制","id":"任务管理与同步机制"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"任务控制块","id":"任务控制块"},{"level":2,"text":"任务创建与栈分配","id":"任务创建与栈分配"},{"level":3,"text":"静态与动态创建","id":"静态与动态创建"},{"level":3,"text":"栈大小估算","id":"栈大小估算"},{"level":3,"text":"栈溢出检测","id":"栈溢出检测"},{"level":2,"text":"信号量","id":"信号量"},{"level":3,"text":"二值信号量","id":"二值信号量"},{"level":3,"text":"计数信号量","id":"计数信号量"},{"level":2,"text":"互斥量","id":"互斥量"},{"level":3,"text":"优先级继承","id":"优先级继承"},{"level":3,"text":"优先级反转问题","id":"优先级反转问题"},{"level":3,"text":"递归互斥量","id":"递归互斥量"},{"level":2,"text":"消息队列","id":"消息队列"},{"level":3,"text":"工作原理","id":"工作原理"},{"level":3,"text":"数据复制 vs 指针传递","id":"数据复制-vs-指针传递"},{"level":3,"text":"邮箱模式","id":"邮箱模式"},{"level":2,"text":"事件组","id":"事件组"},{"level":2,"text":"任务通知","id":"任务通知"},{"level":3,"text":"轻量级同步","id":"轻量级同步"},{"level":3,"text":"通知操作模式","id":"通知操作模式"},{"level":2,"text":"死锁预防","id":"死锁预防"},{"level":3,"text":"死锁条件","id":"死锁条件"},{"level":3,"text":"预防策略","id":"预防策略"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"RTOS 调度原理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/embedded-bare-metal/rtos-basics/rtos-scheduling-principles"},"next":{"title":"FreeRTOS 实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/embedded-bare-metal/rtos-basics/freertos-practice"}}